OL,3,GNEWSAM25 crackdown targets
OL,4,Avehicle-related crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice forces and other agencies have
OL,7,Ftargeted vehicle crime with a series of
OL,8,Fstops on the M25.
OL,10,FSurrey Police and Kent Police stopped
OL,11,Fvehicles at Clacket Lane service
OL,12,Fstation, checking for instances of
OL,13,Frogue trading, road safety concerns and
OL,14,Fother vehicle-enabled crime.
OL,16,FOther organisations including the
OL,17,FEnvironment Agency, motoring agencies
OL,18,Fand trading standards also took part in
OL,19,Fthe day of action on Tuesday, known as
OL,20,FOperation Replicate.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
